WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Hearts: avoid penalty cards; the lowest total wins.
Each heart is 1 point, ♠Q is 13, other cards 0.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:16.250 line:0
North picks 9♥ 6♥ K♦ and clicks Confirm pass;
the other picks stay secret.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:22.000 line:0
Cards move only after all four have confirmed.
This hand passes left, North to East.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.750 line:0
After the pass, East holds ♣2 and leads;
each player plays one card clockwise.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:36.000 line:0
North has clubs and must follow suit:
♣10 is highest and wins the trick.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.750 line:0
North won and leads ♠2;
East and South follow with spades.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:50.000 line:0
West has no spades and discards ♥A.
South’s ♠6 wins and takes 1 penalty point.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:16.000 line:0
Fast-forward: a hand is scored after 13 tricks and
the next is dealt; the pass direction rotates.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:26.000 line:0
Hand ten ends: South reaches 106, over 100,
so the match ends. North is lowest at 37 and wins.
